---
title: "increase_supply (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: value <= (U64_MAX - self.value)
    q_validate --> q_abort: overflow detected
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EOverflow
    q_validate --> q_update: no overflow
    q_update --> q_return: self.value = self.value + value
    q_return --> [*]: return Balance(value)

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: self.value + value <= U64_MAX (no overflow)
        INV-002: total supply conservation - new balance created equals value added
    end note
